## Reflection

This module demonstrated that security begins with the operating system itself. Features such as authentication, permissions, process isolation, and system protection work together to create a secure environment before any antivirus or third-party security software is installed.

Understanding these concepts provides a strong foundation for Windows security, Linux administration, privilege escalation, malware analysis, and incident response.

